{"id":"li_mite","lemma":"límite","pos":"noun","rank":1715,"glosses":["limit, threshold, cutoff, cut-off"],"ipa":"/ˈlimite/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"límites"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c4/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-l%C3%ADmite.wav","examples":[{"text":"Su vanidad no tiene límite.","en":"Her vanity knows no bounds.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639234"},{"text":"Creo sinceramente que la imaginación humana no tiene límites.","en":"I strongly believe that human imagination is limitless.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611712"},{"text":"La fecha límite fue ayer.","en":"The deadline was yesterday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/582494"},{"text":"Creo sinceramente que la imaginación humana carece de límites tangibles.","en":"I strongly believe that human imagination is limitless.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611713"},{"text":"La fecha límite se acerca.","en":"The deadline is drawing near.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/705882"}]}